msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Scrobbles what you watch in Kodi and syncs your library with Trakt"
msgstr "Jagħmel scrobble ta' dak li tara f'Kodi u jissinkronizza l-librerija tiegħek ma' Trakt"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Trakt Relay scrobbles the movies, episodes, live TV and recordings you watch in Kodi to Trakt, and syncs your library with it: collection, watched status, ratings and playback progress, each direction switched on in the settings. It asks for a rating after you watch, and its context menu rates, adds to the watchlist and starts a rewatch of a show. Scrobbles that fail are retried later.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay is a modified version of script.trakt by Trakt.tv, Razzeee and its contributors."
msgstr "Trakt Relay jagħmel scrobble fuq Trakt tal-filmati, l-episodji, it-TV dirett u r-reġistrazzjonijiet li tara f'Kodi, u jissinkronizza l-librerija tiegħek miegħu: kollezzjoni, status ta' x'rajt, ratings u progress tar-riproduzzjoni, b'kull direzzjoni tinxtegħel fis-settings. Jitolbok rating wara li tara, u l-menu tal-kuntest tiegħu jagħti rating, iżid mal-lista ta' x'tara u jibda rewatch ta' programm. L-iscrobbles li jfallu jerġgħu jiġu ppruvati aktar tard.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay hija verżjoni modifikata ta' script.trakt minn Trakt.tv, Razzeee u l-kontributuri tiegħu."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Trakt Relay is not affiliated with or endorsed by Trakt."
msgstr "Trakt Relay mhuwiex affiljat ma' Trakt u mhuwiex approvat minn Trakt."

